{
  "mn41:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 41 ",
  "mn41:0.2": "Sāleyyakasutta ",
  "mn41:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn41:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kosalesu cārikaṁ caramāno mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ yena sālā nāma kosalānaṁ brāhmaṇagāmo tadavasari. ",
  "mn41:2.1": "Assosuṁ kho sāleyyakā brāhmaṇagahapatikā: ",
  "mn41:2.2": "“samaṇo khalu, bho, gotamo sakyaputto sakyakulā pabbajito kosalesu cārikaṁ caramāno mahatā bhikkhusaṅghena saddhiṁ sālaṁ anuppatto. ",
  "mn41:2.3": "Taṁ kho pana bhavantaṁ gotamaṁ evaṁ kalyāṇo kittisaddo abbhuggato: ",
  "mn41:2.4": "‘itipi so bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho vijjācaraṇasampanno sugato lokavidū anuttaro purisadammasārathi satthā devamanussānaṁ buddho bhagavā’. ",
  "mn41:2.5": "So imaṁ lokaṁ sadevakaṁ samārakaṁ sabrahmakaṁ sassamaṇabrāhmaṇiṁ pajaṁ sadevamanussaṁ sayaṁ abhiññā sacchikatvā pavedeti. ",
  "mn41:2.6": "So dhammaṁ deseti ādikalyāṇaṁ majjhekalyāṇaṁ pariyosānakalyāṇaṁ sātthaṁ sabyañjanaṁ; ",
  "mn41:2.7": "kevalaparipuṇṇaṁ parisuddhaṁ brahmacariyaṁ pakāseti. ",
  "mn41:2.8": "Sādhu kho pana tathārūpānaṁ arahataṁ dassanaṁ hotī”ti. ",
  "mn41:3.1": "Atha kho sāleyyakā brāhmaṇagahapatikā yena bhagavā tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā appekacce bhagavantaṁ abhivādetvā ekamantaṁ nisīdiṁsu; appekacce bhagavatā saddhiṁ sammodiṁsu, sammodanīyaṁ kathaṁ sāraṇīyaṁ vītisāretvā eka